WEBVTT

00:17:57.531 --> 00:18:00.200
What about alternative
intelligence and love?

00:18:01.660 --> 00:18:03.120
JW: We'll teach it.

00:18:03.161 --> 00:18:04.162
HW: We’ll teach it?

00:18:04.162 --> 00:18:07.749
JW: Yeah. And listen, any of you who ever
fell in love with your teddy bear,

00:18:07.749 --> 00:18:09.709
which is all of you, know what it's like

00:18:09.751 --> 00:18:13.004
to have an intense relationship
with a nonbiological lifeform.

00:18:13.046 --> 00:18:14.589
(Laughter)

00:18:15.882 --> 00:18:18.343
HW: Jeanette Winterson, I love you.

00:18:18.385 --> 00:18:20.679
JW: Thank you.
HW: Thank you so much. Thank you.